     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRRelatedPersonLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRRelatedPersonLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRRelatedPersonLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-related-person</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-related-entity</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>relatedEntity</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.identifier</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Pas de champ id explicite porté par relatedEntity.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.name</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>relatedEntity.relatedPerson.name</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.name.family</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>relatedEntity.relatedPerson.name.family</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.name.given</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>relatedEntity.relatedPerson.name.given</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMRelatedPerson.name.prefix</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R